WEBVTT

00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:29.826
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.684
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:01:54.368 --> 00:01:55.665
Randy! Hurry!

00:01:55.736 --> 00:02:00.333
We've got the worst luck! Running
into these guys HERE of all places!

00:02:01.709 --> 00:02:04.508
"Power of the gnomes,
| command your hand to appear!”

00:02:07.681 --> 00:02:09.149
Randy!

00:02:09.216 --> 00:02:11.014
Wh- What the...?

00:02:12.219 --> 00:02:14.313
Damn! Can't pull it out!

00:02:14.388 --> 00:02:16.584
Ryna, just leave me here!

00:02:16.657 --> 00:02:18.785
What? Not for this!

00:02:19.126 --> 00:02:21.254
"Evil spirits born in
the forest of darkness..."

00:02:21.795 --> 00:02:23.729
Forget me! Just run!

00:02:23.797 --> 00:02:25.231
No! There it goes!

00:02:30.371 --> 00:02:31.497
Come on, hurry.

00:02:32.473 --> 00:02:33.167
Randy!

00:02:42.783 --> 00:02:45.650
This feeling... Can it be...?

00:02:58.532 --> 00:03:01.263
| see it!
The southern fortress!

00:03:01.335 --> 00:03:03.463
Whew! We finally made it!

00:03:03.537 --> 00:03:05.665
Now we can rest up a little.

00:03:05.739 --> 00:03:08.606
They say there's a
clue there to finding...

00:03:08.676 --> 00:03:11.611
...the Dark Elves who
stole the crystal ball.

00:03:11.679 --> 00:03:13.841
Right! Let's hurry!

00:03:13.914 --> 00:03:16.178
I'm gettin' some chow
time when we get there!

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.275
I'M taking a bath.

00:03:21.322 --> 00:03:24.348
I'm Spark and a party of four
others! We're the pursuit team!

00:03:24.892 --> 00:03:27.088
We've been waiting for you!
This way.

00:03:50.985 --> 00:03:53.044
The southern fortress...

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.090
That feeling I had
before came from this place.

00:03:56.156 --> 00:03:57.749
Something's wrong...

00:04:01.395 --> 00:04:03.386
Any clues about the intruders?

00:04:03.464 --> 00:04:06.490
A party of two people saw
what appeared to be them.

00:04:06.567 --> 00:04:09.730
They aren't citizens of
Flaim, though...

00:04:10.337 --> 00:04:13.864
Eyewitnesses, huh?
Let's speak to them.

00:04:13.941 --> 00:04:17.809
Right now?
Gimme a break!

00:04:18.545 --> 00:04:19.842
Garrack?!

00:04:19.913 --> 00:04:24.043
I'm really hungry!
I'm going to eat first.

00:04:24.118 --> 00:04:25.347
Me, too!

00:04:25.419 --> 00:04:26.818
Leaf?!

00:04:26.887 --> 00:04:28.981
| want to get washed up first.

00:04:29.056 --> 00:04:32.253
I don't want to keep walking around
with all this sand on me!

00:04:32.426 --> 00:04:33.689
Sorry, Captain.

00:04:33.761 --> 00:04:34.956
<i>W-Hey!</i>

00:04:35.029 --> 00:04:39.899
Of course, we don't mind if you
go talking to them first, okay?

00:04:39.967 --> 00:04:43.130
You don't mind... Hey, you two!

00:04:44.571 --> 00:04:46.903
Jeez... What's with those two?!

00:04:46.974 --> 00:04:50.467
Don't be so angry.
They're just getting ready...

00:04:50.544 --> 00:04:53.570
...so that they can be
ready to fight at any time.

00:04:53.647 --> 00:04:56.241
Is that how mercenaries usually act?

00:04:56.316 --> 00:04:57.784
Exactly.

00:04:57.851 --> 00:05:00.013
Well, even so, that attitude...

00:05:00.087 --> 00:05:04.456
Try to understand without getting
angry. Those are your comrades.

00:05:04.525 --> 00:05:07.551
Those two don't seem to
be trying to understand ME.

00:05:08.562 --> 00:05:12.226
| wanted to get after those
Dark Elves as soon as possible!

00:05:30.484 --> 00:05:31.542
Comrades...

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:35.679
A star of fate?

00:05:37.691 --> 00:05:40.217
Yes. Your very own star.

00:05:40.761 --> 00:05:44.254
One you can't find unless
you travel with comrades.

00:05:44.465 --> 00:05:47.127
And Mother was your star,
wasn't she?

00:05:47.201 --> 00:05:52.230
I have two stars now. A little star
as well who shines like its mother.

00:05:52.306 --> 00:05:54.331
Neese, it's you.

00:05:55.909 --> 00:06:00.471
The time has come for you to
make a distant journey as well.

00:06:00.547 --> 00:06:02.811
To find my star of destiny?

00:06:03.283 --> 00:06:05.752
| fear it won't
be a pleasant journey.

00:06:05.819 --> 00:06:09.380
But as long as you have
comrades who will help you fight...

00:06:09.456 --> 00:06:11.584
...I know you will find your star.

00:06:11.658 --> 00:06:14.821
My star of destiny...

00:06:17.397 --> 00:06:21.265
Comrades... And
my star of destiny...

00:06:21.335 --> 00:06:23.201
I wonder if I'll find them.

00:06:30.377 --> 00:06:33.005
Some people from the castle
have come to question you.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.048
Come with me, please.

00:06:35.916 --> 00:06:37.816
Ryna...

00:06:37.885 --> 00:06:39.683
I know, Randy.

00:06:40.521 --> 00:06:44.480
I've kept the truth that
we're thieves from them so far.

00:06:45.325 --> 00:06:47.453
Just lie back and rest.

00:06:50.998 --> 00:06:52.295
I've brought her.

00:06:52.366 --> 00:06:55.461
Where are the Dark Elves?!
How did you see them?!

00:06:55.536 --> 00:06:57.129
Uh, well...!

00:06:57.204 --> 00:06:58.729
Spark!

00:06:59.506 --> 00:07:00.667
Calm yourself.

00:07:00.741 --> 00:07:03.267
<i>R-Right.</i>

00:07:04.645 --> 00:07:09.242
Forgive me. I'm Spark,
a knight in training from Flaim.

00:07:10.083 --> 00:07:11.573
My name's Ryna.

00:07:11.652 --> 00:07:14.178
My partner and I came to Flaim
to get work as mercenaries.

00:07:14.822 --> 00:07:16.984
Where's your partner?

00:07:17.057 --> 00:07:20.220
Resting in the barracks.
He was hurt by those things.

00:07:20.327 --> 00:07:23.319
We don't have anyone here
who can cast healing spells.

00:07:23.397 --> 00:07:26.298
If there's anything I can do,
I'd be glad to help.

00:07:26.667 --> 00:07:27.998
Thank you.

00:07:28.068 --> 00:07:29.797
I'll take you to him.

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:31.463
Will you tell me about it?

00:07:31.538 --> 00:07:33.165
Yes.

00:07:34.208 --> 00:07:36.176
It was on the night before last.

00:07:36.243 --> 00:07:38.234
We were walking,
on our way to Blade...

00:07:41.582 --> 00:07:43.880
They suddenly
appeared from the river.

00:07:43.951 --> 00:07:46.477
Dark Elves! Five of them!

00:07:46.553 --> 00:07:47.918
From the river?

00:07:47.988 --> 00:07:51.219
Dark Elves can move through water.

00:07:51.291 --> 00:07:54.352
Once they left the dry desert,
they probably...

00:07:54.461 --> 00:07:56.520
...used the river to move south.

00:07:57.264 --> 00:08:00.598
They attacked
as soon as they saw us.

00:08:00.667 --> 00:08:02.931
With five against two,
there was no way we could win.

00:08:03.003 --> 00:08:05.734
We immediately ran away,
but it didn't work...

00:08:09.576 --> 00:08:11.271
A monster?

00:08:11.345 --> 00:08:13.780
Yes. It suddenly sprang
up from the ground.

00:08:13.847 --> 00:08:16.179
I know what that monster is!

00:08:19.052 --> 00:08:20.144
Leaf! Really?

00:08:24.157 --> 00:08:25.682
Watch this.

00:08:25.759 --> 00:08:28.922
"Power of the gnomes!
| command your hand to appear!”

00:08:35.302 --> 00:08:36.463
That's it!

00:08:36.536 --> 00:08:39.631
The Dark Elves can do
shamanist magic as well.

00:08:39.706 --> 00:08:42.437
All right, we see!
Now break that spell fast!

00:08:42.509 --> 00:08:45.274
It's all right.
It'll vanish naturally on its own.

00:08:50.317 --> 00:08:52.809
All right, let's have
a look at that wound.

00:08:53.987 --> 00:08:55.887
What the devil is this?

00:09:01.828 --> 00:09:03.796
First, let's get you healed.

00:09:04.231 --> 00:09:09.135
"Myrii, great god of war.
Heal this man's wounds."

00:09:19.179 --> 00:09:23.446
If you ran into the Dark Elves here,
then if we set out right now...

00:09:23.517 --> 00:09:27.750
...we could catch up with
them before they leave Blade.

00:09:27.821 --> 00:09:30.654
Before we do,
there's one thing I want to ask.

00:09:32.059 --> 00:09:34.790
Why did you survive?

00:09:34.861 --> 00:09:38.491
| sure as hell wouldn't have
let any witnesses live.

00:09:38.565 --> 00:09:40.294
I don't know why!

00:09:40.367 --> 00:09:43.803
The Dark Elves vanished right
after they wounded Randy.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.634
Sounds suspicious.

00:09:45.706 --> 00:09:48.801
Garrack, are you
saying she's lying?!

00:09:48.875 --> 00:09:50.843
Captain, are you
saying you believe her?!

00:09:50.911 --> 00:09:54.472
Look in her eyes and you'll see!
Her eyes say she isn't lying!

00:09:54.548 --> 00:09:59.110
Her eyes...
Must be nice to be so young.

00:09:59.186 --> 00:10:01.655
Wha... How DARE you insult me!

00:10:01.722 --> 00:10:05.090
| think this is the best
way to waste time, guys.

00:10:05.859 --> 00:10:08.954
Shouldn't we try to work
together more as a team?

00:10:09.029 --> 00:10:11.054
We've only been
companions for two days.

00:10:11.131 --> 00:10:12.792
Aren't you asking a little much?

00:10:12.866 --> 00:10:15.733
| wish you would take
this a bit more seriously!

00:10:16.169 --> 00:10:19.230
The Dark Elves stole
the Soul Crystal Ball!

00:10:19.306 --> 00:10:21.468
One of the implements of
the Destroyer...

00:10:21.541 --> 00:10:23.168
...which can destroy the world!

00:10:23.243 --> 00:10:27.009
The entire future of Lodoss
is riding on this mission!

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.449
Spark, run for it!

00:10:44.097 --> 00:10:45.394
That's...!

00:11:03.784 --> 00:11:05.218
What is that thing?!

00:11:05.285 --> 00:11:08.186
I don't know! I've never
seen a monster like it!

00:11:08.255 --> 00:11:10.690
But it's their trap!

00:11:10.757 --> 00:11:13.692
Their? The Dark Elves' trap?

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:14.750
Exactly.

00:11:24.905 --> 00:11:27.465
They implant the
monster into a human body...

00:11:27.541 --> 00:11:31.978
...and it begins to grow rapidly
once a healing spell is used on it.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.439
A monster?!

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:41.178
It must be one of the hellspawn
from the dark forests of Marmo.

00:11:41.455 --> 00:11:42.718
What about Randy?!

00:11:42.789 --> 00:11:45.383
He's already been absorbed
as the monster's host.

00:11:46.193 --> 00:11:49.026
| don't think there was any way
| could have saved him.

00:11:49.096 --> 00:11:50.393
No...

00:11:50.464 --> 00:11:52.262
Can't you do anything?!

00:11:52.332 --> 00:11:57.532
To destroy the monster...
we'd have to kill the host.

00:12:05.412 --> 00:12:07.005
Aldo, look out!

00:12:07.514 --> 00:12:10.313
"M-M-Manna, source of
a-a-all magic power..."

00:12:10.383 --> 00:12:11.612
Move!

00:12:14.721 --> 00:12:16.746
I— 1, uh...!

00:12:16.823 --> 00:12:20.384
If you're gonna go to pieces in
front of the enemy, then stand back!

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.792
Garrack, watch what you say!

00:12:22.863 --> 00:12:27.027
I've seen too many mercs buy
it because of guys like him!

00:12:28.168 --> 00:12:29.693
| don't wanna be one of them!

00:12:29.769 --> 00:12:31.635
Once you're dead, you're dead.

00:12:31.705 --> 00:12:33.070
You two...!

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.040
Hold on!

00:12:35.609 --> 00:12:38.510
"Great god Myrii,
who rules over war."

00:12:39.179 --> 00:12:42.171
"Grant us thy divine protection
in the coming battle!"

00:12:42.249 --> 00:12:47.210
"Give us the resolve of iron
and the courage of fire!"

00:12:50.323 --> 00:12:52.724
Well? You feel braver now, right?

00:12:52.792 --> 00:12:53.657
Yes!

00:12:53.727 --> 00:12:55.491
Everyone panics
in their first battle!

00:12:55.562 --> 00:12:59.328
It is how the god Myrii
tests all humans equally!

00:12:59.399 --> 00:13:02.664
All right! Let's fight
together and beat this monster!

00:13:02.736 --> 00:13:03.965
Take care of Ryna!

00:13:04.037 --> 00:13:05.027
Right!

00:13:07.407 --> 00:13:11.901
To destroy the monster,
we'd have to kill the host.

00:13:13.413 --> 00:13:14.812
Let's go!

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:32.694
"Manna, source of all magic power!”

00:13:32.766 --> 00:13:35.360
"Become a blade of light
to slice my enemy apart!”

00:13:46.079 --> 00:13:47.740
Damn! This isn't working!

00:13:47.814 --> 00:13:51.773
Spark! You have to rush towards
the host's room from here!

00:13:53.553 --> 00:13:55.544
Unless we attack the host directly,

00:13:55.622 --> 00:13:57.818
we'll never be able to stop
this creature!

00:13:57.891 --> 00:13:59.484
<i>R-Right!</i>

00:13:59.559 --> 00:14:02.324
Aldo, use your magic to confine
the monster's movements!

00:14:02.395 --> 00:14:03.453
Right!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.022
Greevus, you back up the others!

00:14:07.234 --> 00:14:09.828
Garrack! Leaf!
Open a path for me!

00:14:09.903 --> 00:14:11.564
I'll go in when you do!

00:14:11.638 --> 00:14:14.699
Aw, hell! You grabbing the
choice duty on this one, Captain?

00:14:14.774 --> 00:14:17.835
Never mind about that.
You sure about this, Captain?

00:14:18.645 --> 00:14:21.307
This is your captain's order!
Now carry it out!

00:14:21.381 --> 00:14:22.712
Right, right!

00:14:23.583 --> 00:14:25.017
Let's go!

00:14:45.138 --> 00:14:47.004
"Manna, source of all magic!”

00:14:47.073 --> 00:14:49.303
"Become a ball of fire
and smash the enemy!"

00:14:54.314 --> 00:14:57.181
"Spirits of fire!
Roaring flames burning bright!”

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.810
"Breathe your fire
into our enemy's body!

00:15:03.623 --> 00:15:04.852
Now, Spark!

00:15:04.924 --> 00:15:05.584
Right!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.474
He's still alive...

00:15:23.843 --> 00:15:28.337
Can I do this? Even to
save other peoples' lives?

00:15:28.415 --> 00:15:30.941
What are you waiting for,
Captain?! Kill him now!

00:15:39.526 --> 00:15:40.459
Randy!

00:15:41.127 --> 00:15:42.390
Hold it! It's too dangerous!

00:15:42.462 --> 00:15:43.793
Randy!

00:15:53.039 --> 00:15:54.507
<i>Randy</i>

00:15:58.311 --> 00:16:02.578
What are you doing, Captain?!
The guy's mindless! Don't hesitate!

00:16:02.916 --> 00:16:04.077
But...!

00:16:11.758 --> 00:16:13.624
Captain! Kill him now!

00:16:14.694 --> 00:16:16.253
Garrack! Ryna!

00:16:18.198 --> 00:16:21.224
Leaf! I have to do this!

00:16:34.147 --> 00:16:36.115
Wh- What's happening?

00:16:40.987 --> 00:16:43.388
This is... Is it holy magic?

00:16:57.804 --> 00:17:00.068
It can't be...

00:17:03.109 --> 00:17:05.669
"Marfa, mother of the earth.”

00:17:06.279 --> 00:17:09.408
"Purify this soul which
evil has taken control of."

00:17:19.993 --> 00:17:23.019
The monster...
It's crumbling away...

00:17:38.211 --> 00:17:39.303
Randy...

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:52.023
Randy!

00:17:57.363 --> 00:17:59.229
RANDY™

00:18:09.476 --> 00:18:11.103
Delicious!

00:18:11.177 --> 00:18:14.306
You can really chow down
anywhere, can't you?

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:17.008
Hey, I'm a merc. Want some?

00:18:17.083 --> 00:18:18.812
Please, eat it all.

00:18:18.885 --> 00:18:22.048
Implanting a monster
like that in a human body...

00:18:22.322 --> 00:18:25.223
Typical Dark EIf dirty tactic.

00:18:34.667 --> 00:18:38.035
Randy... Rest in peace.

00:18:38.705 --> 00:18:40.799
I swear I'll avenge you.

00:18:40.874 --> 00:18:43.741
I'm joining him on his quest.

00:18:48.047 --> 00:18:51.347
I- Lady Neese!
What are you doing here?!

00:18:51.417 --> 00:18:52.851
You know her?

00:18:52.919 --> 00:18:55.081
No... Could that be it...?

00:18:55.154 --> 00:18:56.144
Aldo!

00:18:57.457 --> 00:19:01.826
This girl is Neese, the daughter
of Slayn, the great wizard.

00:19:02.795 --> 00:19:06.288
The daughter of Master Slayn?!
Neese...?!

00:19:07.166 --> 00:19:08.759
One of the Six Heroes...?

00:19:08.835 --> 00:19:13.033
Neese, the high priestess of Marfa,
was my grandmother.

00:19:13.106 --> 00:19:15.473
| was named in her honor.

00:19:15.542 --> 00:19:17.169
Oh. Right...

00:19:17.243 --> 00:19:20.804
Look, thanks
for saving us before.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:24.111
That was the will of Marfa,
the earth goddess.

00:19:24.984 --> 00:19:27.919
By the way, what are you
doing out here by yourself?

00:19:28.721 --> 00:19:31.053
The gods led me here...

00:19:31.357 --> 00:19:34.054
I'm following a dark nightmare.

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:46.200
Welcome to Lodoss Island!

00:19:46.272 --> 00:19:48.900
And now, what you've been waiting
for, the second part of the show!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.412
Under orders from King Kashue...

00:19:55.481 --> 00:19:59.213
...I'm protecting the granddaughter
of Neese, one of the Six Heroes.

00:19:59.319 --> 00:20:00.081
Along the way,

00:20:00.153 --> 00:20:03.179
a gang of evil monsters has
sprung up to block our path!

00:20:03.256 --> 00:20:08.558
But I won't lose! Because |
am Spark, knight of Flaim!

00:20:14.767 --> 00:20:17.930
Well, that introduction
SOUNDS cool at least...

00:20:18.004 --> 00:20:21.167
...but so far my duties as
a knight have been pretty lame.

00:20:21.674 --> 00:20:23.403
Oh! Over there!

00:20:25.545 --> 00:20:26.637
Above you!

00:20:29.282 --> 00:20:31.774
Oh, my. What a wonderful cake.

00:20:33.853 --> 00:20:36.220
Who the heck set this stupid trap?!

00:20:37.123 --> 00:20:40.787
Delicious. I can sense the deep
feeling of the person who made this.

00:20:42.829 --> 00:20:46.163
That's right. The sweet
trap of the Dark EIf...

00:20:46.633 --> 00:20:48.431
Over there!

00:20:48.501 --> 00:20:50.560
Oh, so you finally noticed me.

00:20:50.637 --> 00:20:52.765
It's the Dark EIf
with the sweet tooth!

00:20:52.839 --> 00:20:54.329
How dare you set this trap!

00:20:54.407 --> 00:20:57.809
If you want to get out of this forest
alive, then give me those cookies!

00:20:57.877 --> 00:21:01.245
Otherwise, you'll be drowning
in sweet, tasty traps!

00:21:01.648 --> 00:21:04.447
What?! I'll get you
before you get me!

00:21:11.624 --> 00:21:14.457
- Well? Had enough?
- D- Damn you...!

00:21:14.527 --> 00:21:16.052
Let's try this.

00:21:17.263 --> 00:21:19.163
They suck!

00:21:19.232 --> 00:21:21.200
Proper oven temperature
is essential for cookies!

00:21:21.267 --> 00:21:24.430
| can taste how hard you tried,
but you've got a long way to go!

00:21:24.704 --> 00:21:26.069
Now try it again!

00:21:26.139 --> 00:21:29.837
I-- I won't forget this!

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:32.735
This, too, is the will of Marfa.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:37.648
Y- You won. HOW?!

00:23:00.099 --> 00:23:02.761
The journey of the mysterious
girl Neese has begun.

00:23:02.835 --> 00:23:07.739
I don't know what her goal is, but
I have a task that I must complete!

00:23:07.807 --> 00:23:11.266
Catching up with the Dark Elves,
we confront them!

00:23:11.611 --> 00:23:14.706
We must recover
the stolen crystal ball!

00:23:15.348 --> 00:23:18.807
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:19.018 --> 00:23:21.646
"Going to War-...
Pursuing a Dark Shadow."
